        "abstract": "It seems like just yesterday I was in beautiful Abu Dhabi for a joint chapter meeting of the IEEE Antennas and Propagation, Microwave Theory and Technologies, Instrumentation and Measurement, and Electromagnetic Compatibility Societies. The IEEE has seen significant growth in activity in the United Arab Emirates (UAE), largely focused on Dubai. However, Abu Dhabi is growing too with many large corporations establishing a presence there. The high-tech engineers employed at these corporations are eager for local opportunities to enjoy quality educational events, such as the workshop organized last November at the Technology Innovation Institute (TII) in Abu Dhabi. More than 50 IEEE members and guests attended the full day workshop. You can read more about the workshop, and the Women in Engineering event also held at TII, starting on page 16 of this issue.",
