        "abstract": "Greetings! First, I would like to thank Vignesh Rajamani for the successful completion of his term as president. He is now the Immediate Past-President (2022–2023), and I will certainly be consulting him on Society business as we move along; he has proven to be such a great asset to our Society. I would also like to thank Alistair Duffy who is an EMC Society Past-President (2020–2021) and is currently an IEEE Division IV Director. EMC Society President isn't just one term, it is a compilation of terms that benefit the Society membership, and we are all extremely happy and honored to serve the Society. The ideas and member benefits Alistair set in motion continued to be implemented in Vignesh's term, embellished in the areas where his passion lies, and will be continued throughout my term.",
